docs/PROGRESSION_RESONANCE_PLAN.md:26:Most visible quest completion still collapses into gold, even when the game has much stronger rewards already implemented. Gold is useful as a general economy lubricant, but it is too weak as the primary quest reward. The player should look at a quest and think, "I want that reward," before committing to it.
